5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
There is no patch or plug for this.

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
A bulge like that means the tire needs replacing.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
It can hold air for weeks,

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
then let go without warning — especially at highway speed.

9
